                  "key": "visualization_uuid",
                  "description": "(Required) The UUID of a visualization (*not* of a <<glossary:Document>>, <<glossary:Book>>, or page). The [other](ref:doc-fraud-signals) [two](ref:book-fraud-signals) Detect endpoints return the complete URL, so you won't need to populate this parameter explicitly.\n"
                }
